    overview: 'The Sopranos , writer-producer-director David Chase\'s extraordinary television series, is nominally an urban gangster drama, but its true impact strikes closer to home: Like 1999\'s other screen touchstone, American Beauty, the HBO series chronicles a dysfunctional, suburban American family in bold relief. And for protagonist Tony Soprano, there\'s the added complexity posed by heading twin families, his collegial mob clan and his own, nouveau riche brood.',
